# The ten-clip clipping gate, re-run 2026-09-10 on all three bodies this commit
# quotes a reading for: the two committed in the tree, then the export they were
# cut from.
#
#   python3 scratchpad/gate_receipt.py    (motion.check, the real gate entry)
#   python3 scratchpad/gate_export.py     (the same, on the git blob)
#
# This exists because both the 0.98x and the 5.03x came from runs that did not
# record WHICH file they read, which is the same gap the 394 head-camera figure
# had. Every body here is hashed, so the numbers are bound to a file rather than
# to a session.
#
# Read it as: every clip's worst part over its own limit, then the worst
# reading each part reached anywhere in the ten. Under 1.00 is inside the limit.
# Acc_Glasses is scored against the 60 its declared waiver raises it to
# (pierce-0910.md section 2), not the 30 an undeclared part gets.

# 10 clips: akimbo.vrma, dance.vrma, idleLoop.vrma, modelPose.vrma, peaceSign.vrma, playFingers.vrma, scratchHead.vrma, spin.vrma, squat.vrma, stretch.vrma

